  <ul class="en">
    <li><b>Controller:</b> <%= co.COMPANY_NAME_EN || co.COMPANY_NAME %><% if (co.COMPANY_EMAIL) { %>, <%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %><% } %>. Compliant with Thailand's PDPA (B.E. 2562).</li>
